            "review_title": "Review at Mana Restaurant - Hai Ba Trung D.1",
            "review_text": "Theresa L\nOrpington, United Kingdom281 contributions\n0\nGive it a try\nJun 2026 • Couples\nIn Ho Chi Minh for a few nights and wanted some reasonably priced food, researched some places and Mana caught our eye. Walked in on a Friday evening without booking, we were welcomed at the door and chose where we wanted to sit. The menu has a good choice of dishes, we ordered fresh summer rolls and crab spring rolls with tasty dips for starters, Bun Cha & Com Tam for mains with 2 Saigon beers, it was really delicious and so reasonable at £6.80. Lovely staff who were very attentive.\nRead more\nWritten June 27, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
