            "review_title": "Review at Mana Restaurant - Hai Ba Trung D.1",
            "review_text": "Kunming T\nSingapore, Singapore116 contributions\n0\nGreat food, joyful and relaxed atmosphere, great service, great value!\nJun 2026 • Family\nI love the atmosphere in the restaurant! Authentic Vietnamese food with a unique joyful atmosphere! Heard that the locals call it the yellow shop as the place is coloured yellow!\n\nI ordered the special beef Pho, my friend ordered the pork broken rice, we ordered the rolls, iced coffee, and alot more!\n\nGreat value, great taste! The staff team also was very helpful!\n\nAt first, The pork broken rice didnt look so good, when the manager saw it, they quickly changed it and it was amazing!\n\nHighly reccomended if you are looking for a casual place with great food and a wonderful joyful and chill atmosphere!\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
