            "review_title": "Review at Mana Restaurant - Hai Ba Trung D.1",
            "review_text": "George Severin\nHamburg, Germany849 contributions\n5\nTraditional Vietnamese restaurant\nMar 2024 • Friends\nSince our hotel was nearby, we saw this restaurant. \nIt gave us a traditional impression and we decided to eat there for dinner. The food came quickly and was tasty.\nThe staff don't speak English and serve in silence but with a smile. The menu is also in English and has photos of the different dishes. Therefore, choosing and ordering is easy. The prices are reasonable. \nWe went there twice for dinner and were satisfied.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 29, 2024",
